/target
/Cargo.lock.bak
*.pdb
# Coverage runs drop .profraw next to the binary they instrumented, and
# the integration tests spawn that binary from the repo root, so the
# artifacts land in the working tree rather than under /target.
*.profraw
# Project-local MCP config: servers with their commands/args, plus any
# per-developer env keys. Each dev fills in their own; secrets stay out
# of the repo. Use .mcp.json.example if you want a tracked template.
.mcp.json
